  "texts": {
    "preamble": "M/S. Cooperative Milk Producet Union ... vs State Of Jk And Anr on 23 February, 2024 Author: Wasim Sadiq Nargal Bench: Wasim Sadiq Nargal S. No. 17 Regular list In The High C0Urt 0F Jammu & Kashmir And Ladakh At Srinagar Owp No. 900/2016 M/S. Cooperative Milk Producet Union Ltd. ...Petitioner(s) Through: Mr. Mir Riyaz, Adv. Vs. State of Jk and Anr. ...Respondent(s) Through: None Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Wasim Sadiq Nargal, Judge Order",
    "facts": "The report of the Registry reveals that the Registry has issued a chain of dockets/notices to the office of Additional Deputy Commissioner, Anantnag for summoning the record of case titled Food Safety Officer Qazigund Vs. Mohammad Jabar Mir and Ors. In the aforesaid backdrop, Registry is directed to seek report at the first instance from the office of Additional Deputy Commissioner, Anantnag, as to why the record as summoned by this Court has not been send to the Registry of this Court.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
